  "behavior_change": "Adds opt-in rgpudcn=<mask> (1 trace, 2 translate, 4 DCN 3.02 pool, 8 Raphael DMCUB firmware, 16 inert dc_dmub_srv guard) and rgpudcntrace=<lines>. Routes dc_create 0xfea5e (sets hw_internal_rev 60 for family 0x8f and interposes the cgs_device read/write slots), dc_hardware_init 0xff053 (logs DMCUB state, installs an inert dc_dmub_srv when DMUB never attached), generic_reg_wait 0x110bd7 (names each wait) in AMDRadeonX6000Framebuffer, and HWLibs _dmcub_set_fw_entry_info 0x7a38 (registers dcn_3_1_5_dmcub.bin 0x05003500 through _dmcub_load_fw). Register translation is generated from the Linux DCN 3.0.2/3.1.5 headers (307 moved, 1484 dropped, pipe power domains renumbered, 9 field permutations, DMCUB soft reset CNTL bit 17 -> CNTL2 bit 0); the Navi DALSMC mailbox 0x1628a/0x16273/0x16274 is emulated and never reaches the silicon. Also adds rgpuvd120 (CoreDisplay virtual-display refresh COW in WindowServer), not set on this card. All other boot arguments are unchanged from metal-132.",
